# GitHub slice issue body template

Use in GitHub; do not instantiate in the repository.

Owning issue / decision revision; parent when present:
Objective and exclusions:
Dependencies (also use native relationships):
Directed owner and file/module scope; worker/chat identity if delegated:
Actual base commit, named branch and integration target; worktree if used:
Agent model/effort when applicable; delegation follows docs/project-management.md#conditional-orchestration:
Validation and acceptance:
Return contract: result, changed paths, commit/PR, exact checks/evidence, blockers and remaining work.

FINAL: verify required evidence and merged architecture/user-documentation reconciliation before closing parent.
